{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_00285","headline":"游长宁公主流杯池二十五首 十一 · 上官昭容","name":"游长宁公主流杯池二十五首 十一","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"暂尔游山第，淹留惜未归。\n霞窗明月满，涧户白云飞。\n书引藤爲架，人将薜作衣。\n此真攀玩所，临睨赏光辉。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"上官昭容","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_00285.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_00285","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}